From fdffa4a3e46bfdb5eb8d677dad4575656ff1ac0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: samuel <samuel.madureira23@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 13:47:33 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] audio: WASAPI autoconvert + device-paced mixer; wwsjob
 PM image id configurable; cellPad configurable fighting keymap

- cellAudio: AUTOCONVERTPCM|SRC_DEFAULT_QUALITY, 40ms buffer, mixer tops the
  device up block by block (187.5 blocks/s, one event per block), QPC clock
  fallback when no device.
- spu: LBP's image_id==2 wwsjob hacks keyed on g_spu_wwsjob_image /
  g_spu_wwsjob_fallback_image (defaults 2/1 = LBP).
- cellPad: keyboard map from keymap.ini / PAD_KEYMAP_FILE / PAD_KEYMAP.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
